    ["<div class='botslin'><a class='uk-icon-justify uk-icon-edit' title='Inserir valor do visor' onclick='ins_visor(101)'></a><a class='uk-close floatd' id='cls101' onclick='fechaabinha(101)'></a></div>Juro Simples<br/>Taxa de Juros <br><table class='mtab'><tr> <td style='width:100%;text-align:left'>Valor Presente:</td> </tr><tr> <td><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Valor Presente' id='cx101_0' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx101_0')\" ></td> </tr><tr> <td style='width:100%;text-align:left'>Períodos (tempo):</td> </tr><tr> <td><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Períodos (tempo)' id='cx101_1' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx101_1')\" ></td> </tr><tr> <td style='width:100%;text-align:left'>Montante:</td> </tr><tr> <td><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Montante' id='cx101_2' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx101_2')\" onkeypress='if(event.keyCode==13) c_jsi()'></td> </tr></table><button type='button' class='uk-button uk-button-default' onclick='c_jsi()'>Calcular</button>"],
    ["<div class='botslin'><a class='uk-icon-justify uk-icon-edit' title='Inserir valor do visor' onclick='ins_visor(102)'></a><a class='uk-close floatd' id='cls102' onclick='fechaabinha(102)'></a></div>Juro Simples<br/>Juro Anual para Mensal <br><table class='mtab'><tr> <td>ia:</td><td style='width:100%'><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Taxa de Juro Anual' id='cx102_0' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx102_0')\" onkeypress='if(event.keyCode==13) c_jsiam()'></td> </tr></table><button type='button' class='uk-button uk-button-default' onclick='c_jsiam()'>Calcular</button>"],
    ["<div class='botslin'><a class='uk-icon-justify uk-icon-edit' title='Inserir valor do visor' onclick='ins_visor(103)'></a><a class='uk-close floatd' id='cls103' onclick='fechaabinha(103)'></a></div>Juro Simples<br/>Juro Mensal para Anual <br><table class='mtab'><tr> <td>im:</td><td style='width:100%'><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Taxa de Juro Mensal' id='cx103_0' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx103_0')\" onkeypress='if(event.keyCode==13) c_jsima()'></td> </tr></table><button type='button' class='uk-button uk-button-default' onclick='c_jsima()'>Calcular</button>"],
    ["<div class='botslin'><a class='uk-icon-justify uk-icon-edit' title='Inserir valor do visor' onclick='ins_visor(104)'></a><a class='uk-close floatd' id='cls104' onclick='fechaabinha(104)'></a></div>Fator do Valor Presente <br><table class='mtab'><tr> <td style='width:100%;text-align:left'>Taxa de juros:</td> </tr><tr> <td><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Taxa de juros' id='cx104_0' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx104_0')\" ></td> </tr><tr> <td style='width:100%;text-align:left'>Número de Prestações:</td> </tr><tr> <td><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Número de Prestações' id='cx104_1' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx104_1')\" onkeypress='if(event.keyCode==13) c_fpv()'></td> </tr></table><button type='button' class='uk-button uk-button-default' onclick='c_fpv()'>Calcular</button>"],
    ["<div class='botslin'><a class='uk-icon-justify uk-icon-edit' title='Inserir valor do visor' onclick='ins_visor(105)'></a><a class='uk-close floatd' id='cls105' onclick='fechaabinha(105)'></a></div>Termo Geral de uma PA<br/>a<sub>n</sub> = a<sub>1</sub> + (n-1).r <br><table class='mtab'><tr> <td>a<sub>1</sub>:</td><td style='width:100%'><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Primeiro Termo' id='cx105_0' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx105_0')\" ></td> </tr><tr> <td>r:</td><td style='width:100%'><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Razão' id='cx105_1' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx105_1')\" ></td> </tr><tr> <td>n:</td><td style='width:100%'><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Índice do Termo a ser calculado' id='cx105_2' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx105_2')\" onkeypress='if(event.keyCode==13) c_gpa()'></td> </tr></table><button type='button' class='uk-button uk-button-default' onclick='c_gpa()'>Calcular</button>"],
    ["<div class='botslin'><a class='uk-icon-justify uk-icon-edit' title='Inserir valor do visor' onclick='ins_visor(106)'></a><a class='uk-close floatd' id='cls106' onclick='fechaabinha(106)'></a></div>Soma de uma PA<br/>S<sub>n</sub> = ((a<sub>1</sub>+a<sub>n</sub>)n)/2 <br><table class='mtab'><tr> <td>a<sub>1</sub>:</td><td style='width:100%'><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Primeiro Termo' id='cx106_0' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx106_0')\" ></td> </tr><tr> <td>a<sub>n</sub>:</td><td style='width:100%'><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Quantidade de termos a somar' id='cx106_1' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx106_1')\" ></td> </tr><tr> <td>n:</td><td style='width:100%'><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Índice do último termo' id='cx106_2' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx106_2')\" onkeypress='if(event.keyCode==13) c_spa()'></td> </tr></table><button type='button' class='uk-button uk-button-default' onclick='c_spa()'>Calcular</button>"],
    ["<div class='botslin'><a class='uk-icon-justify uk-icon-edit' title='Inserir valor do visor' onclick='ins_visor(107)'></a><a class='uk-close floatd' id='cls107' onclick='fechaabinha(107)'></a></div>Termo Geral de uma PG<br/>a<sub>n</sub> = a<sub>1</sub>.q<sup>n-1</sup> <br><table class='mtab'><tr> <td>a<sub>1</sub>:</td><td style='width:100%'><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Primeiro Termo' id='cx107_0' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx107_0')\" ></td> </tr><tr> <td>q:</td><td style='width:100%'><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Razão' id='cx107_1' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx107_1')\" ></td> </tr><tr> <td>n:</td><td style='width:100%'><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Índice do Termo a ser calculado' id='cx107_2' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx107_2')\" onkeypress='if(event.keyCode==13) c_gpg()'></td> </tr></table><button type='button' class='uk-button uk-button-default' onclick='c_gpg()'>Calcular</button>"],
    ["<div class='botslin'><a class='uk-icon-justify uk-icon-edit' title='Inserir valor do visor' onclick='ins_visor(108)'></a><a class='uk-close floatd' id='cls108' onclick='fechaabinha(108)'></a></div>Produto de uma PG<br/>P<sub>n</sub> = a<sub>1</sub><sup>n</sup> . q<sup>(n(n-1))/2</sup> <br><table class='mtab'><tr> <td>a<sub>1</sub>:</td><td style='width:100%'><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Primeiro Termo' id='cx108_0' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx108_0')\" ></td> </tr><tr> <td>q:</td><td style='width:100%'><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Razão' id='cx108_1' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx108_1')\" ></td> </tr><tr> <td>n:</td><td style='width:100%'><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Quantidade de Termos a calcular' id='cx108_2' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx108_2')\" onkeypress='if(event.keyCode==13) c_ppg()'></td> </tr></table><button type='button' class='uk-button uk-button-default' onclick='c_ppg()'>Calcular</button>"],
    ["<div class='botslin'><a class='uk-icon-justify uk-icon-edit' title='Inserir valor do visor' onclick='ins_visor(109)'></a><a class='uk-close floatd' id='cls109' onclick='fechaabinha(109)'></a></div>Soma de uma PG<br/>S<sub>n</sub> = (a<sub>1</sub>(q<sup>n</sup>-1))/(q-1) <br><table class='mtab'><tr> <td>a<sub>1</sub>:</td><td style='width:100%'><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Primeiro Termo' id='cx109_0' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx109_0')\" ></td> </tr><tr> <td>q:</td><td style='width:100%'><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Razão' id='cx109_1' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx109_1')\" ></td> </tr><tr> <td>n:</td><td style='width:100%'><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Quantidade de Termos a calcular' id='cx109_2' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx109_2')\" onkeypress='if(event.keyCode==13) c_spg()'></td> </tr></table><button type='button' class='uk-button uk-button-default' onclick='c_spg()'>Calcular</button>"],
    ["<div class='botslin'><a class='uk-icon-justify uk-icon-edit' title='Inserir valor do visor' onclick='ins_visor(110)'></a><a class='uk-close floatd' id='cls110' onclick='fechaabinha(110)'></a></div>Número Binomial<br/> (<sub>p</sub><sup>n</sup>) = n!/(p!(n-p)!) <br><table class='mtab'><tr> <td>n:</td><td style='width:100%'><input type='text' class='cemp' title='' id='cx110_0' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx110_0')\" ></td> </tr><tr> <td>p:</td><td style='width:100%'><input type='text' class='cemp' title='' id='cx110_1' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx110_1')\" onkeypress='if(event.keyCode==13) c_nb()'></td> </tr></table><button type='button' class='uk-button uk-button-default' onclick='c_nb()'>Calcular</button>"],
    ["<div class='botslin'><a class='uk-icon-justify uk-icon-edit' title='Inserir valor do visor' onclick='ins_visor(111)'></a><a class='uk-close floatd' id='cls111' onclick='fechaabinha(111)'></a></div>Probabilidade k vezes em n<br/> (<sub>k</sub><sup>n</sup>)p<sup>k</sup>(1-p)<sup>n-k</sup> <br><table class='mtab'><tr> <td>k:</td><td style='width:100%'><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Número de acontecimentos' id='cx111_0' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx111_0')\" ></td> </tr><tr> <td>n:</td><td style='width:100%'><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Número de acontecimentos' id='cx111_1' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx111_1')\" ></td> </tr><tr> <td>p:</td><td style='width:100%'><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Probabilidade' id='cx111_2' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx111_2')\" onkeypress='if(event.keyCode==13) c_pkn()'></td> </tr></table><button type='button' class='uk-button uk-button-default' onclick='c_pkn()'>Calcular</button>"],
    ["<div class='botslin'><a class='uk-icon-justify uk-icon-edit' title='Inserir valor do visor' onclick='ins_visor(112)'></a><a class='uk-close floatd' id='cls112' onclick='fechaabinha(112)'></a></div>Distância entre Ponto e Reta<br/>d<sub>Pr</sub> = (|ax<sub>1</sub> + by<sub>1</sub> + c|)/√(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup>) <br><table class='mtab'><tr> <td>a:</td><td style='width:100%'><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Coeficiente da reta (ax)' id='cx112_0' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx112_0')\" ></td> </tr><tr> <td>x:</td><td style='width:100%'><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Incógnita x' id='cx112_1' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx112_1')\" ></td> </tr><tr> <td>b:</td><td style='width:100%'><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Coeficiente da reta (bx)' id='cx112_2' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx112_2')\" ></td> </tr><tr> <td>y:</td><td style='width:100%'><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Incógnita y' id='cx112_3' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx112_3')\" ></td> </tr><tr> <td>c:</td><td style='width:100%'><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Coeficiente' id='cx112_4' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx112_4')\" onkeypress='if(event.keyCode==13) c_dpr()'></td> </tr></table><button type='button' class='uk-button uk-button-default' onclick='c_dpr()'>Calcular</button>"],
    ["<div class='botslin'><a class='uk-icon-justify uk-icon-edit' title='Inserir valor do visor' onclick='ins_visor(113)'></a><a class='uk-close floatd' id='cls113' onclick='fechaabinha(113)'></a></div>Média Aritmética <br><table class='mtab'><tr> <td style='width:100%'><input type='text' class='cemp' title='Separe os elementos da amostra por ponto e vírgula (;)' id='cx113_0' onblur=\"ultimofield('cx113_0')\" onkeypress='if(event.keyCode==13) c_mediaaritmetica()'></td> </tr><tr> <td style='width:100%;font-style:italic;font-size:12px'>Separe por ponto e vírgula (;):</td> </tr></table><button type='button' class='uk-button uk-button-default' onclick='c_mediaaritmetica()'>Calcular</button>"],
